{"summary":"Jump through tricky geometry loops and test your reflexes in this arcade game!","description":"Ready for the thrilling interstellar journey? Welcome to Geometry Loop, the ultimate arcade jumping game that will test your skills, reflexes, and timing! Navigate your character across the surface of mysterious planets, dodging obstacles and mastering gravity.\n\nA lot of planets, including the Gold Planet.\nNew Features: skins, Puzzle Mode, and Marathon.\n\nFeatures:\n🌌 Dynamic Planetary Environments: Explore a variety of beautifully designed planets, each with unique challenges and stunning visuals.\n\n🌀 Addictive Gameplay: Simple yet challenging controls. Tap to jump and master the timing to avoid traps and obstacles.\n\n🧩 Puzzle Mode: Solve creative challenges that test your logic and precision. Find the best way to reach the goal.\n\n🏃 Marathon Mode: Push your limits in an endless run across ever-changing planets. How far can you go?\n\n🏆 Leaderboards: Compete with friends and players worldwide. Climb the leaderboards and prove your skills.\n\nEnjoy the game for all ages.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $16.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SiXwj4qqdGo?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/G8Oi-Mw3GeVM4kjFTgNpel5GmIbAHeqJ3Kj8nb6KMIySQfesKSU5HAZBCO-B5li3MV2UDXf20cGFRtGahwdrgg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zteUlOONIbDy_CdAA6VUAUXE4v17dgPkU7R4OnRF_VvsIKIidrh5xCZywIZD8L-hVgNlT2ikKuoVL8vWufwS","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fO-nKEEP93FGoXM_6hm5dQUDzh2-sgbRP9zMNVn__-vh8NIOEk7zhoMtQlcAfwhZSEBUcp0GxEDnBncb_LaIGw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2I88BJRq_kgLMr0DFaI-XphC-GopVBeVDLEc6H8GsAtFv2-FOY2RU-WrJh7t8LVc5zA-vQPixNnjKaua3upwwA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3nleHkGUgXyu_VlGw__ShMWsrkfk1q9jP-Jbi9hwAg2y_sBp5A-3x0w2GNh-wuVAeW9_7GNVEYyiCnsa87CD1mQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/11FI_TmuXauVOWLonneSaUEdNCU1fCSm7zdd8Rfmt